        "wordAbsenceReason": "The Word opens with a title and duration and goes straight into Day 1. It has no standalone introduction summarising the full route."
      },
      "text": "This 11-day route takes you from the jungles and archaeological sites of Western Belize to the beaches of Placencia. The first part of the trip includes Caracol, Rio Frio Cave, Rio On Pools and a full-day excursion to Actun Tunichil Muknal. A private transfer along the Hummingbird Highway then takes you to the Caribbean coast, where you have time for snorkelling and relaxing."
